{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_03",
  "title": "奇談怪論",
  "storyCode": "IC-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1c0fabd61a32e78bb18fdcdc027fe03f5f6aa6ec0dae5720e75136e5fca5d081",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g4_durinsquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺到，嶄新，完整。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，別圍著我轉了，小傢伙。看到你能恢復活力，我也很高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，檢修，很擅長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，請求協助，小小協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "編號0428，同伴，已退役，互動不回應，請求協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與本機一起出廠，共同建造設施，現在，不回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不回應？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你別著急，帶我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，這邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "停止活動的機械",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些結構，這些部件......唔，果然比起單純的維修而言，難度是要大一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼原理？這個結構又是幹什麼的？和大姐的身體完全不一樣，也從沒聽可露希爾師父說過類似的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果接上這裡......不，還是小心一點，它也是你的朋友吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朋友？祖瑪瑪，多次以朋友定義關係。暫不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢修無法執行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能找到些資料的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "資料？圖書館，保存資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能帶我去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "輔助導航，光榮的使命。祖瑪瑪，這邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一種我從沒在書上見過的互動模式，地上人，值得研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g2_fountainlake"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉醺醺的杜林人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_573_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "極境，我們來比比誰能頭朝下最快從超級旋轉滑梯上倒著飛出去，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈，讓你見識見識什麼叫羅德島的水上傳說！\n棘刺那傢伙可是從沒在這項目上贏過我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，我沒有一點興趣和你在這裡閒逛，我寧願在該死的阿卡胡拉叢林裡被鉗獸吃掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼說嘛，斯第奇，我只是真的想聽聽你的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管際崖城的其他居民怎麼認為，我知道誰才是優秀的建築設計師——無論是你的那位老師，還是你，都當之無愧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座際崖城了不起的穹頂，我從沒在杜林的任何一本建築學書籍中看過類似的設想，如果你能願意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你把我叫來就是為了這種事，那我建議我們還是不要浪費彼此的時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你不喜歡我對“大水坑”的設計，這裡的這些滑梯也好，噴泉也好，的確算不上高明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但，斯第奇，你知道我真正想設計的是什麼嗎？和你一樣，是我們頭頂的這一片穹頂！我們曾經競爭了那麼久的穹頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈哈，在我面前說這些，還真是大膽。你真的很想打架嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我是不錯的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！不錯的對手！真是高看我了，我們是不是應該擁抱在一起，痛哭流涕一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是認真的，斯第奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想問你，為什麼在幾年前，你放棄了繼續在穹頂改造方案上投入努力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "表決大會上再也看不到你的設計，你退出了。難道你真的不再試圖用自己的美學來說服人們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你真的就接受了芬奇大師的不告而別？他可是你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別來教訓我，卡奇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是膩了，厭煩了，就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是受夠了把自己的所有野心都寄託在這個破穹頂上，還要想盡辦法說服我們親愛的際崖城居民們把票投給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我受夠了和你這樣“心懷夢想的建築設計師”一起到處兜售方案的日子了，無聊透頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽好了，現在我們頭頂上的這個玩意，不管它漏水還是爆炸，就算哪天你們投票決定乾脆把它拆了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都跟我毫無關係，隨你們的便！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這穹頂是你老師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我再說一遍，\n隨！\n你！\n們！\n的！\n便！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯第奇，我本來還想拉你和我合作，我們一起出一套嶄新的穹頂方案，一定能說服絕大多數際崖城的居民同意改建。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你這麼不想和穹頂扯上關係，我不會勉強。我尊重你的決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，能不能請你花一點時間，聽聽我對穹頂改造的新想法？也給我點建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我完全不在乎——不，你還是先講講吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，我認為應該多來點色彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繁複的幾何花紋能增添穹頂的美感！像是玻璃水果盤那樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黃色、綠色、紅色與藍色的碰撞！讓際崖城的市民們抬頭時也能感受到別樣的美麗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是白天還是夜晚，新的穹頂每時每刻都會是大家視線的焦點！每時每刻都是大家尋找心靈寧靜時的港灣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一大塊奪目閃耀的寶石！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g2_fountainlake"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣！就我個人看來，是個十足精彩的設計，有很多創新點，我很滿意。不過我也會認真聽取你的意見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你改主意了？太好了，那我們就一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不准動這座穹頂哪怕一根手指。我會拼上全力阻止你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才還在說自己根本不在乎，隨我的便來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本以為你們想復活這具屍骸，或者乾脆埋葬它，我無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你總不能用這種方式褻瀆它吧！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡奇·敘光",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_567_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這不是體現了我的滿滿尊重嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不行，我今天一定要揍你一頓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g5_library_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢修資料，圖書館，位置：分類檔案室五十九區，開放式書架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看，嗯......這是杜林的文字？完全看不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讀取。書名：《大冒險家地上遊記》《杜林美酒的127種常見釀造法》"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續檢索，新發現：《你從未想過的超瘋狂杜林人大計畫》《資訊控制論基於社會行為影響的研究》......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小傢伙，你確定這裡有我們要找的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "機率：42.377%。杜林人，整理行為少見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，這邊的字我看得懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三個書架的《奇談怪論》，已經過期十多年了。這一排是維多利亞語的書......居然還有卡西米爾的《紅酒報》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會用它們瞭解地面上的語言、文化和消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，怪不得我們交流起來幾乎沒有障礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是杜林人自己辦的雜誌？《爆改！自走車瘋狂大出擊》，“訂購雜誌即贈送原型車一輛......”。這就是外面街上滿地亂跑的那些小玩意吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克羅綺可是強推她的自走車改裝生意，那些補充包在際崖城都賣爆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她號稱“大家都喜歡那一點隨機性”，我是搞不懂啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，為什麼用薩爾貢語來辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據說是為了繼承《奇談怪論》的優良傳統，雜誌就該是薩爾貢語！我們杜林是這麼認為的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在找這本書嗎？《3秒鐘打造屬於你的助理機器人》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該能派上點用場，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯綺！0429向您問好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們認識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的杜林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，自我介紹一下，我叫黛柯綺·銀幣，是際崖城的工業代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是助理機器人的管理員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管理員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，際崖城的助理機器人由我建造，由我監督，由我管轄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "R3-E3型助理機器人0429，你在這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本機，向祖瑪瑪提交申請，檢修0428。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "0428已經退役了。現在，回到你的崗位上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明白。遵從。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，你和助理機器人的互動很奇怪，它的反應，有些......異常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的交流有什麼奇怪的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道，或許奇怪的......就是交流本身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不和這些小傢伙交流？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......它們只是執行工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣不好，我和我的大姐就經常聊天。她會讓我倚靠在她冰涼的金屬外殼上，用機械臂拍拍我的肩膀，還有她動聽的合成音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這在《奇談怪論》裡可沒寫過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g10_lakegarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，大豐收！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然沒買到合適的衣服，不過這些小玩意也很棒！不認識的礦石，奇怪金屬的風鈴，還有這些可愛的小掛件......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的是！居然是嘉維爾幫我選的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是嘉維爾你願意和我買成對的項鍊就更好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她沒問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，沒事，這孩子從小就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從書裡看到過，這種囤積行為在某些地區被稱作“札拉克症”，可能是因為壓力或者別的什麼原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的，我很開心！這些對我而言都是重要的回憶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，隨你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，阿芙朵嘉，這是個烏薩斯名字，你老家是烏薩斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫阿芙朵嘉·銳筆。標準的杜林式名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可阿芙朵嘉還是烏薩斯語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是閒聊，你太緊張了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，那裡不是我的家，我只是來自那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的搞不懂，你為什麼總是對地上這麼警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我還小的時候，我很喜歡和家族為我聘請的文法老師待在一起。她大部分時間很無聊，不過偶爾也會說些有意思的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯有很多描寫故鄉的文學，我的老師總是對這些大為讚歎，我們會分析其中的母題，寫作的方法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那時，我以為人人都會懷念故鄉，遠遊的人們往往最終會回到自己出發的地方，在那裡長眠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來我發現，不是的，當對於故鄉的回憶只有痛苦，當遷居的地方更加適宜，我們為什麼還要為那個只是曾經落腳過的地點而感懷呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它和旅途上的驛站也沒什麼不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿芙朵嘉小姐，你到底為什麼離開烏薩斯呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不想細說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一些讓人作嘔的事。一夜之間我的身份、家人、朋友皆已不在，我簡直是夾著尾巴逃出了那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從烏薩斯，到薩爾貢，再到了地下的杜林城市......這段路可不好走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "連目的地都沒有，又何談好不好走呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是運氣比較好，最後發現了這裡，發現了這座叫際崖城的小城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的杜林人接納了我，那我就會以更大的善意回報他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是我自己選擇的容身之所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，來自地上的一切都休想傷害他們。不管這份傷害是出於純粹的惡，還是只是沒能遂了願的善，都不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是我對你們的告誡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來還想為了表示友好，請你喝一杯呢。那還是算了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個倒不是不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你喝酒的風格倒是很烏薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴，杜林也是這種風格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實在的，我不是個擅長研究心理的醫生，關於人心的那些事情我搞不明白，也懶得搞明白。光是治癒肉體就已經很不容易了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，恐怕你再怎麼假裝，也沒辦法真正變成一個杜林人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還沒有熟悉到互相指出彼此身上問題的程度吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才我聽你和那些杜林小店的店主談天，他們說你寫了一些有關雪原的故事，而且看來不是很流行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊，地下既沒有雪，也沒有平原。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要澄清，我寫這些並不是懷念那裡。這些只是......一些會發生故事的土壤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道那裡會發生故事，這一點就不夠杜林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些痕跡終究無法掩蓋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我會努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算只是做自己，這幫杜林人還是會興高采烈地接納你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果我想要一個新的自己呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這幫杜林人總是會興高采烈地接納別人，這次他們遇上的是我和你們。下次呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你既然是個醫生，就不會不明白人心中的惡。就不會不明白人們為了互相傷害會做出怎樣無恥的行徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會聲稱這是什麼種族問題。是地上的一切把我們塑造成了這樣，塑造成了這副習慣於訴諸暴力、渴求財貨、充滿野心的樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾在這其中浸淫，所以我想要一個新的自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惡是會習得和傳染的，地下的人們沒有經歷過，他們沒有對於惡的抵抗力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的沒錯，我沒辦法變成一個杜林人。但作為一個際崖城的市民，我願意付出努力保護這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——保護這份未曾被污染過的純真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是說過，杜林人自己能處理好問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別拿我的話來教訓我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
